return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-07T10:55:06+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-07T10:55:06+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly™'=>'Tranzly™','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','Multilingual WordPress, one post per language: linked translations of posts, pages, categories, media text, widgets and the site title, with your old Tranzly translations imported.'=>'WordPress ya lugha nyingi, chapisho moja kwa kila lugha: tafsiri zilizounganishwa za machapisho, kurasa, kategoria, maandishi ya midia, vidude na kichwa cha tovuti, pamoja na tafsiri zako za zamani za Tranzly zilizoagizwa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® answered, but not with a connection this plugin understands. Nothing was saved.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu, lakini si kwa muunganisho ambao programu-jalizi hii inaelewa. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','This site has forgotten its connection. Zinn Digital® could not be told just now, so support staff will see it as unused until it is removed on their side.'=>'Tovuti hii imesahau muunganisho wake. Zinn Digital® haikuweza kuarifiwa sasa hivi, kwa hivyo wafanyakazi wa usaidizi wataiona kama haijatumiwa hadi iondolewe kwa upande wao.','The Zinn Digital® address this site is set to use is not a secure (https) address, so nothing was sent.'=>'Anwani ya Zinn Digital® ambayo tovuti hii imewekwa kutumia si anwani salama ya (https), kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotumwa.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached from this site. Check that the site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti hii. Hakikisha kwamba tovuti inaweza kuanzisha miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ujaribu tena.','This site\'s connection to Zinn Digital® was revoked. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Muunganisho wa tovuti hii na Zinn Digital® ulibatilishwa. Unganisha tena ili kuendelea.','Zinn Digital® no longer recognises this site\'s connection. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Zinn Digital® haitambui tena muunganisho wa tovuti hii. Unganisha tena ili kuendelea.','Too many requests were sent from this site or address. Wait a little, then try again.'=>'Maombi mengi mno yametumwa kutoka kwa tovuti au anwani hii. Subiri kidogo, kisha ujaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® could not accept this request. Check the email address and the message, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kukubali ombi hili. Angalia anwani ya barua pepe na ujumbe, kisha ujaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® could not handle the request just now. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kushughulikia ombi hilo kwa sasa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Ufikiaji huu wa muda wa usaidizi umeisha muda wake.','The licensing service is not available on this site.'=>'Huduma ya leseni haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','The trial could not be started here. Continue on the trial page instead.'=>'Jaribio halikuweza kuanzishwa hapa. Endelea kwenye ukurasa wa jaribio badala yake.','One post per language, linked together'=>'Chapisho moja kwa kila lugha, zikiwa zimeunganishwa pamoja','Keeps your old Tranzly translations'=>'Huweka tafsiri zako za zamani za Tranzly','Translate in the background'=>'Tafsiri chinichini','Latest WordPress and PHP, tested every release'=>'Toleo jipya la WordPress na PHP, limejaribiwa kila toleo linapotoka','Security by design'=>'Usalama kiasili','Interface in 58 languages, right-to-left ready'=>'Kiolesura katika lugha 58, kiko tayari kwa mwelekeo wa kulia-kwenda-kushoto','Unlimited languages'=>'Lugha zisizo na kikomo','DeepL (the current integration, kept)'=>'DeepL (muunganisho wa sasa, umehifadhiwa)','AI models with your own key'=>'Miundo ya AI ukiwa na u