e to connecting this site first.'=>'Kubali kuunganisha tovuti hii kwanza.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Weka anwani sahihi ya barua pepe.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Kubali kutuma taarifa za usaidizi kwanza.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Andika mada na ujumbe.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe ambayo usaidizi unaweza kujibu.','AI providers'=>'Watoaji wa AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Watengenezaji wa ChatGPT. Mwenye uwezo mzuri wa pande zote.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Watengenezaji wa Claude. Mahiri katika uandishi na hoja makini.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Miundo ya Gemini ya Google. Ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya AI ya Ulaya yenye miundo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Miundo ya gharama ya chini ambayo ni bora katika uandishi na uandikaji msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja wa miundo kutoka kwa watoa huduma wengi tofauti.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na modeli inayofanya kazi kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Jumla (hutumika wakati hakuna kitu maalum zaidi kilichowekwa)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Msimbo na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayoyatumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Vifunguo vyako vimesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwenye hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — si kwetu kamwe.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hivyo unamlipa mtoa huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huna uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza zaidi baadaye.','Next'=>'Inayofuata','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayooana na OpenAI, inayoishia na /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma itauomba.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au fungua akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'ukurasa wa funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Unda ufunguo mpya na uunakili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Bandika hapa chini na ubonyeze "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji salio kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'ongeza salio','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Kitufe kilichohifadhiwa kinaishia na …%s — bandika kipya ili kubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Ufunguo (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na ujaribu','Providers'=>'Watoa huduma','Provider'=>'Mtoa huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu-jalizi: sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au weka ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Uingize tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho lilifaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho lilishindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Muundo upi wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaonyesha pendekezo letu kwa kazi hiyo. Orodha hii inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, ikisomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi mifano','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Onyesha upya orodha za miundo kutoka kwa watoa huduma','Images'=>'Picha','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Unganisha OpenAI au Google Gemini ili kuunda picha.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Muundo mpya zaidi wa picha wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Utafutaji wa tovuti (upachikaji)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter ili uunde fahirisi ya utafutaji ya tovuti yako.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Kielelezo kipya zaidi cha upachikaji cha mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Kubadilisha hii hujenga upya faharasa ya utafutaji ya kila programu-jalizi inayoitumia.','best quality'=>'Ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'Gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'Ya kasi zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza muundo mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Muundo mpya umetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili kuutumia mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la modeli','Add model'=>'Ongeza kielelezo','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hivyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha upya programu-jalizi, au uwashe masasisho ya kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la kawaida tu la kupakua ndilo linalotumwa: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna chochote kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha imetiwa saini, na orodha inayoshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, na uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'Orodha mpya zaidi ilisakinishwa','already up to date'=>'imesasishwa tayari','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'Upakuaji haukufaulu ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Haikuweza kufikia Zinn Digital®; orodha ya sasa inaendelea kutumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wa hali yao','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa vitufe vya API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma asiyejulikana.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Inakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Miundo imehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina kamili la modeli, kwa mfano jinsi lilivyoandikwa kwenye nyaraka za mtoa huduma.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s imeongezwa. Ichague chini ya "Muundo upi wa kutumia".','Model removed.'=>'Muundo umeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Masasisho ya kila siku yamezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imeangaliwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI ulihifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la mojawapo ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au weka ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Uiweke tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijawekwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna modeli iliyochaguliwa kwa ajili ya kazi hii. Chagua moja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hatumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI anayeweza kutengeneza picha aliyeunganishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa OpenAI au Google Gemini katika mipangilio ya AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kutengeneza picha. Chagua OpenAI au Google Gemini kwa ajili ya picha kwenye mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia kielelezo chochote cha picha. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya picha.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI aliyeunganishwa anayeweza kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji. Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia modeli yoyote ya uwekaji (embedding). Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa utafutaji wa tovuti.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kutengeneza faharasa ya utafutaji. Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au huduma inayooana kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inaweza kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya wavuti (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haipatikani kutoka kwa tovuti iliyohifadhiwa mtandaoni).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa wako hewani, mwenyeji wako huenda anazuia miunganisho inayotoka, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema akaunti yako haina salio au mgawo uliosalia. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako katika akaunti yako nao, kisha ujaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako. Huenda umeandikwa vibaya, umebatilishwa au umekwisha muda wake. Fungua ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s imekataa ombi hili kwa ufunguo wako. Ufunguo unaweza usiwe na idhini ya kufikia modeli au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji kuthibitishwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Muundo wa "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka %2$s kwa ufunguo wako. Chagua muundo mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi kielelezo cha "%1$s". Chagua kielelezo kingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au upate toleo jipya la mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inapunguza kasi ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutuma maombi. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au uongeze kikomo cha kasi yako nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inakabiliwa na matatizo kwa sasa (kukatika kwa huduma au kuelemewa kwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo lolote kwenye mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, wasiliana na usaidizi ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa umbizo ambalo programu-jalizi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua muundo mwingine au wasiliana na usaidizi.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (inayoendana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo kwa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma hajaorodhesha kielelezo chochote cha maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza kielelezo wewe mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s imejibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Wajibu wako wa mtumiaji hauruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI cha kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, vikomo na ruhusa za majukumu hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zikikokotolewa kutoka kwa bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana huhesabiwa kama sifuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Lini','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inatumika kwa','Model'=>'Muundo','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni za ndani / nje','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Bado hakuna maombi yoyote ya AI yaliyofanywa.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi ili kusiwe na kikomo. AI itasimama kwa mwezi uliosalia pindi gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hiki.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi kwa mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha tupu kwa bila kikomo.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Usiteue yoyote ili kumruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vikomo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Lugha hiyo si mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti hii.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Tafsiri lazima iwe aina ile ile ya maudhui kama ya asili.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya lugha nyingine za tovuti.','Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Hati za skrini ya usimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe upya kutoka kwenye kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Mteja wa upangishaji? Pata punguzo la %1$d%% kwa %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Kama mteja wa upangishaji wa Zinn Digital® unapata msimbo binafsi wa punguzo la %d%% kwenye malipo yako ya kwanza. Usasishaji ni kwa bei ya kawaida.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Pata nambari yangu ya %d%% na uende kwenye malipo','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Punguzo hili ni la wateja walio na mpango wa kulipia wa ukodishaji wavuti ulio katika hali nzuri. Majaribio ya bila malipo hayakidhi vigezo.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Tayari umetumia punguzo lako la mteja wa upangishaji kwa programu-jalizi hii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hatujaweza kupata nambari yako ya kuthibitisha sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe herufi ndogo au tarakimu 1 hadi 8, kianze na herufi, na kisiwe na jina la programu-jalizi.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" si msimbo wa lugha. Tumia lugha ya WordPress kama vile fr_FR au de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Orodhesha angalau lugha moja.','Translations'=>'Tafsiri','Edit the %s version'=>'Hariri toleo la %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Linganisha toleo la %s kando kwa kando','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Maandishi mbadala','Caption'=>'Maelezo mafupi','Title'=>'Kichwa','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya menyu zako kwa kila lugha.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Hifadhi chapisho hili kwanza, kisha litafsiri hapa.','This one'=>'Hii','Edit'=>'Hariri','Side by side'=>'Kando kwa kando','Translate again'=>'Tafsiri tena','Translate'=>'Tafsiri','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Unda nakala ya kutafsiri kwa mkono','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Tafsiri hutumia mfumo uliowekwa kwa lugha hiyo. Toleo lililohaririwa na mtu halifutwi kamwe kwa kuandikwa jipya juu yake.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Huruhusiwi kutafsiri kipengee hiki.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: imetafsiriwa.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Huu si tafsiri, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kulinda.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Aina hii ya maudhui haijatafsiriwa.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Maandishi %s hayapo tena kwenye tovuti hii. Pakia upya ukurasa.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya lugha zako nyingine.','Compare translation'=>'Linganisha tafsiri','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri tafsiri hii.','This piece now contains formatting. Reload the page to edit it.'=>'Sehemu hii sasa ina umbizo. Pakia upya ukurasa ili kuihariri.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Huu si tafsiri, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kulinganisha.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Asili ya tafsiri hii haipo tena.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Sehemu %s si sehemu ya tafsiri hii tena. Pakia upya ukurasa na ujaribu tena.','Translate on this page'=>'Tafsiri kwenye ukurasa huu','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Kipengee hiki tayari kina toleo katika lugha hiyo.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Injini hiyo ya tafsiri haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','Different engines and AI models per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini na miundo tofauti ya AI kwa kila lugha, hatua ya dharura ya kiotomatiki na ukomo wa matumizi ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendekezwa na sauti kwa kila lugha ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro. Orodha ya maneno yasiyotafsiriwa ni ya bure.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Thamani ya %s si mojawapo ya chaguo zinazoruhusiwa.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Foleni ya mandharinyuma haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Kazi ya tafsiri huendeshwa kama mtu anayeianzisha, kwa hivyo lazima mtumiaji awe ameingia.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Hakuna chochote unachoruhusiwa kutafsiri katika uteuzi huo.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Kipengee hicho si sehemu ya kazi ya tafsiri.','That item is already translated, so there is nothing to retry. To retry every failed item of a job, run wp tranzly jobs retry-failed with the job ID, or retry each one from the job\'s list of what failed.'=>'Kipengee hicho tayari kimetafsiriwa, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kujaribu tena. Ili kujaribu tena kila kipengee cha kazi kilichoshindikana, endesha wp tranzly jobs retry-failed pamoja na kitambulisho cha kazi (job ID), au jaribu tena kila kimoja kutoka kwenye orodha ya kazi hiyo ya vilivyoshindikana.','That item is already waiting to be translated.'=>'Kipengee hicho tayari kinasubiri kutafsiriwa.','There is no translation job with that ID.'=>'Hakuna kazi ya tafsiri yenye kitambulisho hicho.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Huruhusiwi kubadilisha tafsiri hiyo.','Translating this item stopped with an error in WordPress or another plugin. The details are below; retry it once the cause is fixed.'=>'Kutafsiri kipengee hiki kumesimama kwa sababu ya hitilafu katika WordPress au programu-jalizi nyingine. Maelezo yapo hapa chini; jaribu tena mara tu chanzo kitakaporekebishwa.','Tranzly is not set up on this site.'=>'Tranzly haijasanidiwa kwenye tovuti hii.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Kikundi cha kipengee hiki tayari kina toleo la %1$s (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Kipengee hakiwezi kuwa tafsiri yake chenyewe.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Kipengee hicho tayari ni tafsiri ya kitu kingine. Kiondoe kiungo kwanza.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Kiungo cha tafsiri hakikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo ya maudhui hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Tafsiri inaweza kuchapishwa au kuwekwa kama rasimu.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuchapisha aina hii ya maudhui.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Kipengee hiki tayari kimeandikwa kwa lugha hiyo.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Tafsiri hii ilihaririwa na mtu (au iliingizwa), kwa hivyo inalindwa. Ifungue ili kuitafsiri tena.','That item does not exist.'=>'Kipengee hicho hakipo.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri iliyowekwa bado. Ongeza ufunguo wa moja katika Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Injini hiyo ya tafsiri bado haijawekwa: ongeza ufunguo wake kwanza.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Maandishi yale yale yanatafsiriwa na kazi nyingine sasa hivi; kipengee hiki kitatumia jibu hilo.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Hakuna injini ya utafsiri iliyoweza kuchukua kipengee hiki.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injini haikurudisha tafsiri kwa kila sehemu ya kipengee hiki. Hakuna kilichobadilishwa.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Kila lugha lazima iwe mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti, ikiwa na injini inayopatikana.','Each language\'s AI model must name one of the site\'s languages (or all other languages), an AI provider and one of its models.'=>'Muundo wa AI wa kila lugha lazima utaje mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti (au lugha nyingine zote), mtoa huduma wa AI na mojawapo ya miundo yake.','%1$s is not one of the models of %2$s. Pick one from the list, or add it in the AI settings first.'=>'%1$s si mojawapo ya mifano ya %2$s. Chagua moja kutoka kwenye orodha, au uiongeze kwanza kwenye mipangilio ya AI.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Orodha mbadala inaweza kutaja injini zinazopatikana pekee.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Kikomo cha kila mwezi ni kiasi katika dola za US, sifuri au zaidi, kwa injini inayopatikana.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Vipengee vya faharasa lazima viwekwe katika vikundi kulingana na mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Toni imewekwa kwa kila lugha ya tovuti: rasmi chaguo-msingi, zaidi au kidogo, pamoja na maagizo ya hiari.','AI model'=>'Muundo wa AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Muundo wa AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s inakabiliwa na matatizo kwa sasa. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi, au tumia injini nyingine.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia %s. Hakikisha kwamba inaweza kufanya miunganisho inayotoka, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako wa API. Angalia ufunguo kwenye Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Akaunti yako ya %s imetumia kiwango chake au salio lake lote. Weka salio zaidi nao, au tumia mfumo mwingine.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s ametuomba tupunguze kasi. Itajaribiwa tena kiotomatiki.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Maandishi haya ni marefu mno kwa %s kwa mara moja. Gawanya maudhui, au tumia injini nyingine.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s imekataa kutafsiri maudhui haya. Jaribu injini nyingine, au utafsiri kwa mkono.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s haitafsiri lugha hii. Chagua injini nyingine kwa ajili yake.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi cha mwezi huu cha %s kimefikiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna kingine kilichotumwa kwake. Ongeza kikomo katika Tranzly → Engines, au subiri hadi mwezi ujao.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Tafsiri kwa kutumia %s imeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo Tranzly haikuweza kuitambua. Maelezo yapo hapa chini.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kitambulisho cha injini lazima kiwe herufi ndogo, nambari na vistari unganishi.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia kuwezesha bila idhini. Ili kukabidhi leseni kwa mtumiaji wako, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako kisha utume fomu ya mshirika tena.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Je, ungependa kuunganisha %1$s kwenye %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'Washa leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kwenye barua pepe mara tu baada ya ununuzi:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Amilisha leseni kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Washa leseni kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' Toleo la kulipia la %1$s tayari limesakinishwa. Tafadhali liwashe ili uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Toleo lililolipiwa la %1$s tayari limesakinishwa. Tafadhali nenda kwenye %2$s ili kuliwezesha na kuanza kufaidika na vipengele vya %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Washa kiongezi hiki','Activate %s'=>'Amilisha %s','Activate %s features'=>'Washa vipengele vya %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kamilisha Uamilisho wa "%s" Sasa','Activate %s Plan'=>'Washa Mpango wa %s','Activated'=>'Imewashwa','Activating'=>'Inawashwa','Activating license'=>'Inawasha leseni','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Akaunti yako imewashwa kwa mafanikio kwa kutumia mpango wa %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Inayotumika','Add another domain'=>'Ongeza kikoa kingine','Add-Ons'=>'Viongezi','Add Ons for %s'=>'Viongezi vya %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Hatuwezi kupakia orodha ya nyongeza. Huenda likawa ni tatizo kwa upande wetu, tafadhali jaribu kurudi tena baada ya dakika chache.','Add-On'=>'Kijalizo','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ni nyongeza ya kulipia pekee. Lazima ununue leseni kwanza kabla ya kuanzisha programu-jalizi hii.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kijalizo cha %s kimenunuliwa kikamilifu.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Mpango wako wa nyongeza ya %s umesasishwa kwa mafanikio.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Kipindi cha majaribio cha bila malipo cha %s kimeghairiwa kikamilifu. Kwa kuwa nyongeza hii inalipiwa tu, imezimwa kiotomatiki. Ukipenda kuitumia siku zijazo, itabidi ununue leseni.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila programu-jalizi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Tunakujulisha tu kwamba taarifa za nyongeza za %s zinachukuliwa kutoka kwenye seva ya nje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Viongezi vya moduli ya %s','Address Line %d'=>'Mstari wa Anwani %d','Affiliate'=>'Mshirika','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Kutokana na ukiukaji wa masharti yetu ya ushirika, tumeamua kuzuia akaunti yako ya ushirika kwa muda. Ikiwa una maswali yoyote, tafadhali wasiliana na usaidizi.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Akaunti yako ya ushirika ilisitishwa kwa muda.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Ombi lako la kuwa mshirika wa %1$s limekubaliwa! Ingia kwenye eneo lako la mshirika katika: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kutuma maombi ya kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, kwa sasa tumeamua kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asante kwa kutuma maombi ya kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na tutawasiliana nawe tukiwa na taarifa zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'kuki ya ufuatiliaji ya %s baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapoisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bila Malipo lakini HAUTAKUWA na ufikiaji wa vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwezesha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutakuwa na ufikiaji wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele ya %2$s, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya %1$s yako ya bila malipo, lipa kiasi kidogo cha %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubali na Uwezeshe Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Ninakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina Zote','allow'=>'Ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Umeshajiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Tayari umechagua kujiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuyaboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni yasiyojulikana','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Tuma ombi la kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha na Uanze Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tueleze sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia kwa ajili ya kuboresha hapa chini na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia wakati wa ununuzi na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Husisha na akaunti ya mmiliki wa leseni.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Mwandishi','Invalid module ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha moduli si sahihi.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Huna leseni halali ya kufikia toleo la kulipia.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Usakinishaji wa kiotomatiki hufanya kazi kwa watumiaji waliochagua tu.','Premium version already active.'=>'Toleo la kulipia tayari linatumika.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Toleo la programu-jalizi ya kulipia tayari limesakinishwa.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Programu-jalizi ni "Serviceware", kumaanisha haina toleo la msimbo wa kulipia.','Automatic Installation'=>'Usakinishaji wa Kiotomatiki','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kuzima kiotomatiki baada ya:','Average Rating'=>'Kiwango cha Wastani cha Tathmini','Awesome'=>'Ajabu','based on %s'=>'kulingana na %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Kuwa mshirika','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Unapenda %s? Kuwa balozi wetu na upate pesa ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Habari, je, ulijua kuwa %1$s ina programu ya washirika? Ikiwa unapenda %2$s unaweza kuwa balozi wetu na ujipatie pesa taslimu!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Bora','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Kusasisha kwa toleo la Beta kutabadilisha toleo lako lililosakinishwa la %s na toleo jipya zaidi la Beta - tumia kwa tahadhari, na si kwenye tovuti halisi za uzalishaji. Umeonywa.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Imelipishwa %s','Billing'=>'Ulipaji bili','Billing & Invoices'=>'Malipo na Ankara','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Imezuiwa','Blocking'=>'Inazuia','Blog ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Blogu','Body'=>'Mwili','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ndiyo - anwani zote mbili ni zangu','Bundle'=>'Kifurushi','Bundle Plan'=>'Mpango wa Kifurushi','Business name'=>'Jina la biashara','Buy license'=>'Nunua leseni','Buy a license now'=>'Nunua leseni sasa','Cancel'=>'Ghairi','Cancel Installation'=>'Ghairi Usakinishaji','Cancel Subscription'=>'Ghairi Usajili','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Iwapo HUPANGI kutumia hii %1$s kwenye tovuti hii (au tovuti nyingine yoyote) - ungependa kughairi %2$s pia?','Cancel Trial'=>'Ghairi Jaribio','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Kughairi jaribio kutazuia ufikiaji wa vipengele vyote vya kulipia mara moja. Je, una uhakika?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Ghairi %s na Uendelee','Cancelled'=>'Imeghairiwa','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Inaghairi usajili','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Huwezi kupata ufunguo wako wa leseni?','Change License'=>'Badilisha Leseni','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa hivi punde kwa %s. Lazima uthibitishe sasisho hili ndani ya saa 4 zijazo. Ikiwa huwezi kupata barua pepe hiyo, tafadhali kagua folda yako ya barua taka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa hivi punde kwa %s. Mmiliki wa barua pepe lazima athibitishe sasisho ndani ya saa 4 zijazo.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ndiye mmiliki mpya wa akaunti.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Asante kwa kuthibitisha mabadiliko ya umiliki. Barua pepe imetumwa hivi punde kwa %s kwa idhini ya mwisho.','Change Ownership'=>'Badilisha Umiliki','Change Plan'=>'Badilisha Kifurushi','Change User'=>'Badilisha Mtumiaji','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Kwa kubadilisha mtumiaji, unakubali kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti kwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko','Changing user, please wait'=>'Inabadilisha mtumiaji, tafadhali subiri','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Ikiwa hukupokea barua pepe hiyo, jaribu kuangalia folda yako ya barua taka au utafute barua pepe kutoka kwa %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Kamilisha Malipo','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Chagua hadi tovuti %s ili kuwezesha leseni.','City'=>'Jiji','Clear API Cache'=>'Futa Akiba ya API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Futa Data ya Muda ya Masasisho','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Bofya hapa ili kutumia programu-jalizi bila kujulikana jina','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Bofya ili kuona maoni yaliyotoa ukadiriaji wa %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ni anwani ya barua pepe ya mteja wangu','Code'=>'Msimbo','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kandrasi ya %s mteja anaponunua leseni mpya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kwa kuwa tunatenga siku 30 kwa ajili ya uwezekano wa kurejeshewa pesa, tunalipa tu kamisheni ambazo zina zaidi ya siku 30.','Communication'=>'Mawasiliano','Compatible up to'=>'Inaoana hadi','complete the opt-in'=>'kamilisha kujiunga','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hongera','Never miss an important update'=>'Usiwahi kukosa sasisho muhimu','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Chagua kupokea arifa za barua pepe za masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya elimu na ofa za mara kwa mara, na kushiriki maelezo ya kimsingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jiunge ili upokee arifa za barua pepe kuhusu masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vipya, maudhui ya kuelimisha, na ofa za mara kwa mara, pamoja na kushiriki taarifa za kimsingi kuhusu mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukipuuza hili, hakuna shida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri tu.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeanzisha hiari hii ili usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu na utusaidie kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na ifanye vizuri zaidi kile unachohitaji.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tunayofuraha kutambulisha muunganisho wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha tumegundua tovuti %s katika mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji usikivu wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) 