e %1$s hadi sasa? Jaribu vipengele vyetu vyote vinavyolipiwa vya %2$s kwa jaribio la bila malipo la siku %3$d.','Type'=>'Aina','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Imeshindwa kuunganisha kwenye mfumo wa faili. Tafadhali thibitisha vitambulisho vyako.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Kulikuwa na hitilafu isiyotarajiwa ya API wakati wa kushughulikia ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache na ikiwa bado haifanyi kazi, wasiliana na mtunzi wa %s ukitumia yafuatayo:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Hitilafu isiyotarajiwa, jaribu tena baada ya dakika 5. Hitilafu ikiendelea, tafadhali wasiliana na usaidizi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kuondoa %s kutazima leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Kamisheni zisizo na kikomo.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Masasisho yasiyo na kikomo','verbUpdate'=>'Sasisha','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Je, ungependa kuendelea na sasisho?','Update'=>'Sasisha','Update License'=>'Sasisha Leseni','Upgrade'=>'Boresha','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Taarifa Muhimu ya Kuboresha:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Pakia na uwashe toleo lililopakuliwa','User Dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Samahani, hatukuweza kukamilisha usasishaji wa barua pepe. Mtumiaji mwingine mwenye barua pepe hii tayari amesajiliwa.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti 