nekana una toleo jipya zaidi.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea %3$s ya %1$s kwenye kikasha chako cha barua pepe katika %2$s ndani ya dakika 5 zijazo.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Msimbo wa Posta',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s ili kufikia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele ya toleo %2$s, na usaidizi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Masasisho ya kiotomatiki ya usalama na vipengele ya %1$s pamoja na utendakazi unaolipiwa yataendelea kufanya kazi bila kukatizwa hadi %2$s (au leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, kile kitakachotangulia).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vya toleo la %2$s, na usaidizi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuweka hali ya beta ya mtumiaji.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kubadilisha hali ya lebo nyeupe ya leseni.','Annual'=>'Kila mwaka','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", %s hataweza tena kuona jina na barua pepe yako.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Opt Out", data ya uchunguzi haitatumwa tena kwa %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Kwa kukata muunganisho wa tovuti, data ya uchunguzi iliyoshirikiwa hapo awali kuhusu %1$s itafutwa na haitaonekana tena kwa %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Kwa kuchagua kutoshiriki maelezo haya na seva ya masasisho, itabidi uangalie matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha wewe mwenyewe. Si usumbufu tu, bali kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuweka tovuti yako hatarini na kusababisha matatizo yasiyo ya lazima ya utangamano, kwa hivyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena masasisho yoyote ya usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti hii, au tovuti nyingine yoyote.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ghairi %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Inaghairi %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Inaghairi %s...','Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Deactivating'=>'Inazima','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kutenganisha tovuti kutaondoa %s kabisa kutoka kwenye akaunti ya Dashibodi yako ya Mtumiaji.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Kwa uwasilishaji wa kiotomatiki wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi na ulinzi wa leseni, %s inahitaji:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Kwa ajili ya uwasilishaji wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi wa leseni, %s inahitaji','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ni injini yetu ya kutoa leseni na masasisho ya programu','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ikiwa hii ni nakala ya muda mrefu, ili kudumisha sasisho za kiotomatiki na utendaji uliolipiwa baada ya %1$s, tafadhali %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Je, %2$s ni nakala ya %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Jiunge na Mpango wa Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Jiunge na programu ya Beta','License'=>'Leseni','License Key'=>'Ufunguo wa Leseni','License key'=>'Ufunguo wa leseni','Monthly'=>'Kila mwezi','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Majina, slugs, matoleo, na kama yanatumika au la','New Version Available'=>'Toleo Jipya Linapatikana','Optional'=>'Hiari','Plan'=>'Mpango','Products'=>'Bidhaa','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Kushiriki data ya uchunguzi husaidia kutoa utendakazi wa ziada unaofaa kwa tovuti yako, kuepuka kutooana kwa toleo la WordPress au PHP kunakoweza kuharibu tovuti, na kutambua ni lugha na maeneo yapi ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kuboreshwa kwayo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Ili uweze kutumia tena leseni wakati %s haifanyi kazi tena.','Subscription'=>'Usajili','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s itakuwa ikituma data muhimu ya leseni mara kwa mara kwa %2$s ili kuangalia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na kuthibitisha uhalali wa leseni yako.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Kuna %1$s ya %2$s inayopatikana.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha utangamano na kuepuka migongano na programu-jalizi na mandhari ulizosakinisha.','Trial'=>'Majaribio','View %s State'=>'Tazama Hali ya %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Msingi za %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ndiyo, %2$s ni nakala ya %4$s kwa madhumuni ya kujaribu, maandalizi au uendelezaji.','You have a %s license.'=>'Una leseni ya %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Umenunua leseni ya %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho ya %1$s kwenye kikasha chako katika %2$s. Tafadhali hakikisha umebofya kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe hiyo ili %3$s.','days'=>'siku','deactivating'=>'Inazima','hour'=>'saa','hours'=>'masaa','license'=>'Leseni','optional'=>'ya hiari','products'=>'Bidhaa','skip'=>'Ruka','subscription'=>'Usajili','trial'=>'Majaribio','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Bidhaa','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inawashwa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Leseni','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','close windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiunge rasmi','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Vitalu vyenye vipengee vinavyojirudia, na ruwaza zilizosawazishwa','WooCommerce products'=>'Bidhaa za WooCommerce','Comments and reviews'=>'Maoni na tathmini','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'Imetafsiriwa kiotomatiki kutoka %s.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Sarafu za WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Sarafu','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Chanzo cha viwango hakitoi kiwango cha %s, sarafu ya duka.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" si sarafu inayotambuliwa na WooCommerce, au ni sarafu ya duka lenyewe.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Weka kiwango kilicho juu ya sufuri kwa %s, kama vile 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Hatua za kukadiria na miisho ya bei ni kiasi, kama vile 0.05 au 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Sehemu maalum (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Chagua tafsiri, nakili au acha wazi kwa kila sehemu.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Fomu (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Ninaingiza viwango mimi mwenyewe','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Benki Kuu ya Ulaya, husasishwa kila siku (bila malipo, huhitaji akaunti)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Benki Kuu ya Ulaya ilijibu %d. Viwango vya mwisho vimedumishwa.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Mlisho wa Benki Kuu ya Ulaya haukuwa na viwango vyovyote. Viwango vya mwisho vimehifadhiwa.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Chanzo hicho cha viwango vya kubadilisha fedha hakipatikani.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Vijalizo vya SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Mandhari hayo au programu-jalizi hiyo haifanyi kazi kwenye tovuti hii.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilika. Jaribu tena, na kikiendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na msimamizi wa tovuti.','Connect an AI app'=>'Unganisha programu ya AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Ombi hili la muunganisho limeisha muda wake. Rudi kwenye programu na uanze kuunganisha tena.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s inaomba kutumia %2$s kwenye tovuti hii kama %3$s. Inaweza tu kufanya kile ambacho akaunti yako ya WordPress inaruhusiwa kufanya, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote kutoka kwa mipangilio ya mawakala wa AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ilijitambulisha kutoka %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s imejisajili yenyewe kiotomatiki. Endelea tu ikiwa ulianzisha hii kutoka %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Akaunti yako haiwezi kutumia zana hizi kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Baada ya kujibu utarudi kwenye %s.','Allow %s'=>'Ruhusu %s','Do not allow'=>'Usiruhusu','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika inakosekana au ina muundo usio sahihi. Angalia muundo wa ingizo wa uwezo.','The site refused the request.'=>'Tovuti imekataa ombi.','Unknown tool.'=>'Zana isiyojulikana.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wakufanyie kazi kwenye tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress (Claude na ChatGPT kwa kuwaidhinisha hapa, wengine kwa nenosiri la programu) na wanaweza tu kufanya kile ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au toleo jipya zaidi. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zilizo hapa chini na njia zao za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (kikomo cha MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude na ChatGPT: ingia badala yake','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ongeza anwani ya muunganisho kama kiunganishi maalum katika Claude, au kama programu katika hali ya msanidi programu ya ChatGPT. Zinafungua tovuti hii ili uweze kuziidhinisha; hakuna nenosiri la kunakili.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Programu za AI zilizounganishwa kwenye akaunti yako:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Programu nyingine za AI: nenosiri la programu','Create an application password for your user'=>'Unda nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, ukitumia jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: weka ingizo lile lile chini ya "servers" katika .vscode/mcp.json, sio chini ya "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za msanidi programu: uwezo, REST na MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'Tafsiri maudhui ya tovuti hii na uangalie tafsiri zake ukitumia Tranzly.','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'Lugha, tafsiri na hali ya tafsiri.','List languages'=>'Orodhesha lugha','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'Huorodhesha lugha za tovuti. Ya kwanza ni lugha ambayo maudhui asili yameandikwa kwayo.','List translation engines'=>'Orodhesha injini za tafsiri','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'Huorodhesha zana za tafsiri, kama kila moja imesanidiwa, na ipi inatumika wakati hakuna iliyotajwa.','Translate a post or page'=>'Tafsiri chapisho au ukurasa','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'Hutafsiri chapisho au ukurasa mmoja katika lugha moja au zaidi za tovuti kwa kutumia injini ya tafsiri, ikitengeneza kila tafsiri au kuisasisha. Tafsiri mpya huwa rasimu isipokuwa publish ikiwa kweli (true). Tafsiri iliyohaririwa na mtu hurukwa isipokuwa force ikiwa kweli (true).','Codes of languages set up on this site, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'Misimbo ya lugha zilizowekwa kwenye tovuti hii, k.m. de_DE, au de pekee wakati Kijerumani kimoja tu kimeorodheshwa.','The id of a translation engine set up on this site; the default engine when omitted.'=>'Kitambulisho cha injini ya utafsiri iliyosanidiwa kwenye tovuti hii; injini chaguo-msingi inapoachwa.','Translation status'=>'Hali ya tafsiri','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'Ikiwa na kitambulisho cha chapisho: tafsiri ya chapisho hilo kwa kila lugha, iwapo imepitwa na wakati, na nani aliyeandika. Bila kitambulisho: kiasi cha tovuti kilichotafsiriwa, kwa kila lugha.','Translate my site'=>'Tafsiri tovuti yangu','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'Mtiririko wa kazi unaoongozwa: wakala hukagua lugha na injini, hukadiria gharama, na kutafsiri kile kinachokosekana, akiuliza kabla ya kutumia pesa au kuchapisha.','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'Lugha za kutafsiri, k.m. Kijerumani na Kifaransa.','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'Tafsiri tovuti hii ya WordPress kwa: %s. Hatua: 1) ita tranzly-list-languages; ikiwa lugha haipo, niulize kabla ya kuiongeza kwa tranzly-update-settings; 2) ita tranzly-list-engines na uhakikishe kuwa moja imesanidiwa (vinginevyo niambie ni ufunguo upi wa kuongeza); 3) ita tranzly-translation-status kwa tovuti nzima na tranzly-estimate kwa kile kinachokosekana, na uniambie gharama kabla ya kutumia chochote; 4) baada ya mimi kukubali, tafsiri kwa kutumia tranzly-bulk-translate ikiwa inapatikana (Pro), vinginevyo chapisho kwa chapisho kwa kutumia tranzly-translate-post; 5) tafsiri mpya zitasalia kuwa rasimu isipokuwa nikisema zichapishwe; 6) maliza na tranzly-translation-status na uorodheshe kile ambacho bado kinakosekana.','Name at least one language.'=>'Taja angalau lugha moja.','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'Soma ushughulikiaji wa maoni (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'Hurejesha ikiwa maoni yanashirikiwa katika lugha zote au yamewekwa kwa kila lugha.','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'Badilisha ushughulikiaji wa maoni (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'Hushiriki maoni katika tafsiri zote za chapisho au huyaweka kwa kila lugha (hali).','Read the display options'=>'Soma chaguo za kuonyesha','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'Hurejesha kibadilisha lugha na chaguo za kuonyesha sifa.','Change the display options'=>'Badilisha chaguo za uonyeshaji','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'Hubadilisha kibadilishaji (mtindo, bendera, majina, uwekaji) na mstari wa shukrani.','Read the DeepL usage'=>'Soma matumizi ya DeepL','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'Hurejesha vibambo vilivyotumika na kikomo cha ufunguo wa DeepL uliohifadhiwa mwezi huu.','Read the engine settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya injini','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines and AI models, each engine\'s state, the connected AI providers with their models, and this month\'s spend.'=>'Hurejesha injini chaguomsingi na ya akiba, injini na miundo ya AI ya kila lugha, hali ya kila injini, watoa huduma za AI waliounganishwa pamoja na miundo yao, na matumizi ya mwezi huu.','Change the engine settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya injini','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine, per-language engines and per-language AI models (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Everything but the default engine is Pro.'=>'Huweka injini chaguomsingi, injini ya ziada, injini za kila lugha na miundo ya AI ya kila lugha (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Kila kitu isipokuwa injini chaguomsingi ni cha Pro.','ID of the default translation engine (deepl, ai, google or microsoft); empty for automatic.'=>'Kitambulisho (ID) cha mfumo chaguo-msingi wa kutafsiri (deepl, ai, google au microsoft); acha wazi kwa ajili ya kiotomatiki.','Pro: language code => engine ID used for that language.'=>'Pro: msimbo wa lugha => kitambulisho cha injini kilichotumiwa kwa lugha hiyo.','Pro: engine IDs tried in order when the first one fails.'=>'Pro: Vitambulisho vya injini hujaribiwa kwa mfuatano wakati cha kwanza kinaposhindwa.','Pro: engine ID => monthly spending cap in US dollars. An AI provider has its own cap, keyed ai: and the provider id, for example ai:anthropic.'=>'Pro: ID ya injini => kikomo cha matumizi cha kila mwezi kwa dola za US. Mtoa huduma wa AI ana kikomo chake, chenye ufunguo wa ai: na id ya mtoa huduma, kwa mfano ai:anthropic.','Pro: language code => {provider, model} used when the AI engine translates that language; the key * sets the model for every other language. Empty model: the provider\'s recommended one.'=>'Pro: msimbo wa lugha => {provider, model} unaotumika wakati injini ya AI inatafsiri lugha hiyo; ufunguo * huweka kielelezo kwa kila lugha nyingine. Kielelezo tupu: kile kilichopendekezwa na mtoa huduma.','Save an engine key'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo wa injini','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'Huhifadhi ufunguo wa API (na eneo la Microsoft) wa DeepL, Google au Microsoft; kuacha wazi huondoa ufunguo huo. Vifunguo huhifadhiwa vikiwa vimesimbwa kwa njia fiche na havirudishwi kamwe.','Estimate a translation'=>'Kadiria tafsiri','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'Hukadiria herufi na gharama ya kutafsiri machapisho (posts au post_type) katika lugha (langs) kwa injini, kabla ya kutumia chochote.','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'Ingiza faili iliyotafsiriwa (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token that identifies the upload for the import.'=>'Hupakia faili ya Tranzly XLIFF au CSV (maudhui, jina la faili) iliyotafsiriwa kwingineko; hurejesha tokeni inayotambulisha upakiaji huo kwa ajili ya kuingiza.','The XLIFF or CSV file\'s text.'=>'Maandishi ya faili ya XLIFF au CSV.','The file name, e.g. site-de.xlf.'=>'Jina la faili, k.m. site-de.xlf.','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha programu-jalizi za kuhamia kutoka (Pro)','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'Huorodhesha data ya WPML, Polylang na TranslatePress iliyopatikana kwenye tovuti hii ambayo inaweza kuingizwa.','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'Hamisha kutoka WPML, Polylang au TranslatePress (Pro)','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'Huingiza ukurasa unaofuata wa tafsiri kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine ya lugha nyingi (hali: dry-run au run; kielekezi).','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'Andika faili iliyoingizwa (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'Huandika ukurasa unaofuata wa machapisho kutoka kwa faili ya tafsiri iliyopakiwa (rudia na after hadi ikamilike).','Read the integrations'=>'Soma maunganisho','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'Huorodhesha programu-jalizi za SEO, WooCommerce, kijenzi cha kurasa na fomu ambazo Tranzly inatumia na ambazo zinafanya kazi hapa.','List translation jobs'=>'Orodhesha kazi za tafsiri','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'Huorodhesha kazi za tafsiri za chinichini, mpya zaidi kwanza, pamoja na maendeleo.','Start a translation job'=>'Anzisha kazi ya kutafsiri','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'Huanzisha kazi ya chinichini inayotafsiri machapisho yaliyoorodheshwa (posts) au aina nzima ya chapisho katika lugha (langs).','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'Jaribu tena au kabidhi kipengee kilichoshindwa','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'Hujaribu tena kipengee kilichoshindwa (kitendo: retry, kwa hiari kwa kutumia injini nyingine) au hukitia alama kwa ajili ya kutafsiriwa kwa mikono (kitendo: by-hand).','Read a job\'s progress'=>'Soma maendeleo ya kazi','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'Hurejesha maendeleo na hesabu za kazi moja.','Cancel a job'=>'Ghairi kazi','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'Hukomesha kazi; tafsiri zilizokwisha fanywa huwekwa.','Read a job\'s failures'=>'Soma hitilafu za kazi','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'Huorodhesha vipengee vya kazi vilivyoshindwa pamoja na sababu ya kila kimoja.','Read the licence'=>'Soma leseni','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Hurejesha mpango wa Tranzly wa tovuti hii, hali ya leseni, tarehe ya kusasisha na kile kinachojumuishwa kwenye mpango.','Disconnect from support'=>'Tenganisha kutoka kwa usaidizi','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Hutenganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi.','Read the support connection'=>'Soma muunganisho wa usaidizi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Inaonyesha ikiwa tovuti hii imeunganishwa na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®, na kama nani.','Connect to support'=>'Unganisha kwenye usaidizi','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Inaunganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® (jina, barua pepe, idhini).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Idhini ya uchunguzi wa usaidizi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Hurekodi idhini ya msimamizi ya kutuma uchunguzi pamoja na tiketi za usaidizi.','True records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'True hurekodi idhini ya msimamizi ya kutuma uchunguzi pamoja na tikiti za usaidizi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Soma uchunguzi wa tovuti','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Hurejesha taarifa za uchunguzi ambazo tiketi ya usaidizi ingekuwa nazo: matoleo, programu-jalizi amilifu, mipaka na hitilafu za hivi karibuni.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fungua tiketi ya usaidizi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Hutuma tiketi ya usaidizi (mada, ujumbe, aina, barua pepe), pamoja na uchunguzi wa tovuti hii wakati msimamizi amekubali. Haifanyi au kutuma maelezo ya kuingia kamwe.','The ticket subject (up to 200 characters).'=>'Mada ya tikiti (hadi herufi 200).','What happened, or the question.'=>'Kilichotokea, au swali.','The kind of request; help when omitted.'=>'Aina ya ombi; msaada unapoachwa.','Reply address; the connected support email when omitted.'=>'Anwani ya majibu; barua pepe ya usaidizi iliyounganishwa inapoachwa.','Name to reply to.'=>'Jina la kujibu','True attaches this site\'s diagnostics (needs the administrator\'s consent).'=>'True huambatanisha uchunguzi wa tovuti hii (inahitaji idhini ya msimamizi).','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Anza jaribio la bure la Pro','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Inaanza jaribio la siku 14 la Tranzly Pro kwa tovuti hii (hakuna malipo yanayohitajika).','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'Soma uingizaji wa Tranzly 2.x','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'Hurejesha hali na ripoti ya kuleta tafsiri kutoka kwa Tranzly 2.x.','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'Ingiza tafsiri za Tranzly 2.x','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'Hutekeleza uagizaji wa 2.x: jaribio (ripoti pekee), tekeleza, au tendua.','Translate an image\'s text'=>'Tafsiri maandishi ya picha','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'Huhifadhi maandishi mbadala (alt text), jina au maelezo mafupi ya picha (field) katika lugha (lang).','Read the menus per language'=>'Soma menyu kwa kila lugha','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'Hurejesha menyu ambayo kila lugha inaonyesha katika kila eneo la menyu.','Set the menus per language'=>'Weka menyu kwa kila lugha','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'Hupanga menyu kwa kila lugha kwa kila eneo (ramani).','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'Linda au fungua tafsiri','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'Hulinda tafsiri isifutwe na kuandikwa upya na injini (protected: true), au huifungua.','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'Soma ripoti ya ubora (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'Hurejesha ripoti ya ubora wa AI wa tafsiri: alama na sehemu zilizowekewa alama.','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'Idhinisha au kataa tafsiri (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'Huidhinisha tafsiri (na kuichapisha wakati asili inapochapishwa) au huirudisha nyuma (uamuzi, dokezo).','Read a translation side by side'=>'Soma tafsiri kando kwa kando','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'Hurejesha vijisehemu vya tafsiri kando ya vile vya asili, kwa ukaguzi na usahihishaji.','Correct a translation'=>'Sahihisha tafsiri','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'Huhifadhi sehemu zilizosahihishwa za tafsiri (sehemu: ufunguo wa maandishi); maandishi yaliyosahihishwa yanalindwa dhidi ya kutafsiriwa upya.','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'Tenganisha chapisho na tafsiri zake','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'Huondoa chapisho kutoka kwa kikundi chake cha tafsiri; hubakisha lugha yake.','Read a post\'s translations'=>'Soma tafsiri za chapisho','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'Huorodhesha kikundi cha tafsiri cha chapisho: kipengele cha kila lugha pamoja na kichwa chake, hali yake na kiungo cha kuhariri.','Create an empty translation'=>'Unda tafsiri tupu','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'Hutengeneza rasimu ya tafsiri ya chapisho katika lugha (lang) ili kuandikwa kwa mkono, bila injini.','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'Unganisha chapisho lililopo kama tafsiri','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'Hufanya chapisho lililopo (lengwa) kuwa tafsiri ya chapisho hili katika lugha fulani.','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'Kagua tafsiri ukitumia AI (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'Hupanga ukaguzi wa ubora wa AI wa ukurasa unaofuata wa tafsiri za lugha (au machapisho yaliyotolewa).','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'Ukaguzi wa SEO wa lugha nyingi (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'Hukagua tafsiri ili kubaini vichwa vya SEO, maelezo, slugs na hreflang zinazokosekana katika lugha fulani, ukurasa kwa ukurasa.','Change languages and settings'=>'Badilisha lugha na mipangilio','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Huweka lugha za tovuti (lugha: orodha ya msimbo na jina; ya kwanza ni lugha asili), kiambishi awali cha tabaka la sehemu ya mbele, na ikiwa mawakala wa AI (MCP) wanaruhusiwa.','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'Soma maandishi ya maudhui na programu-jalizi','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'Hurejesha maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi (wigo) katika lugha fulani pamoja na tafsiri zake.','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'Tafsiri maandishi ya maudhui na programu-jalizi yaliyokosekana','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'Hutafsiri ukurasa unaofuata wa maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi yasiyotafsiriwa katika lugha kwa kutumia injini chaguomsingi (rudia kwa after hadi ikamilike).','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'Sahihisha maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'Huhifadhi tafsiri zilizosahihishwa za maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi (nyuzi); zinakuwa zinalindwa.','Translate what is missing'=>'Tafsiri kile kinachokosekana','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'Hupanga foleni ya tafsiri ya kila kipengee kinachokosekana (au kilichopitwa na wakati) katika lugha na aina ya chapisho.','List what is missing or out of date'=>'Orodhesha kinachokosekana au kilichopitwa na wakati','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'Huorodhesha matini asili pamoja na hali ya tafsiri yake katika lugha (hali: haipo, imepitwa na wakati, ya sasa), ukurasa kwa ukurasa.','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'Soma maandishi ya tovuti katika lugha','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'Hurejesha kichwa cha tovuti, kaulimbiu na maandishi ya wijeti katika lugha fulani.','Translate a site text'=>'Tafsiri maandishi ya tovuti','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'Huhifadhi maandishi moja ya tovuti (ufunguo) katika lugha, k.m. kichwa cha tovuti au kaulimbiu.','Translate a category or tag'=>'Tafsiri kategoria au lebo','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'Hutafsiri neno moja (kitengo, lebo au sifa ya bidhaa) katika lugha (lang) kwa injini, na kuunda au kusasisha tafsiri yake.','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'Tenganisha neno kutoka kwa tafsiri zake','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'Huondoa neno kutoka kwenye kikundi chake cha tafsiri.','Read a term\'s translations'=>'Soma tafsiri za neno','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'Huorodhesha kikundi cha tafsiri cha kategoria au lebo.','Create a term translation by hand'=>'Unda tafsiri ya neno kwa mikono','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'Hutengeneza tafsiri ya neno katika lugha kwa jina, slug na maelezo unayotoa.','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'Unganisha neno lililopo kama tafsiri','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'Hufanya neno lililopo (lengwa) kuwa tafsiri ya neno hili katika lugha.','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha vyanzo vya maandishi ya mandhari na programu-jalizi (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'Huorodhesha mandhari na programu-jalizi ambazo maandishi yake yanaweza kukaguliwa kwa ajili ya tafsiri, na idadi ya mifuatano iliyo katika kila mojawapo.','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'Kagua mandhari au programu-jalizi kwa ajili ya maandishi (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'Huchanganua ukurasa unaofuata wa faili za PHP za kijenzi kwa ajili ya maandishi yanayoweza kutafsiriwa (rudia ukitumia after hadi ikamilike).','Read the address settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya anwani','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'Hurejesha jinsi lugha zinavyoonekana kwenye anwani (folda, kikoa kidogo au kikoa), slugi na misingi iliyotafsiriwa, na noindex kwa kurasa ambazo hazijatafsiriwa.','Change the address settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya anwani','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'Huweka hali ya anwani (mode), vikoa kwa kila lugha, misingi na sehemu zilizotafsiriwa, noindex_untranslated na mapendekezo ya slug.','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'Kadiria utafsiri wa tovuti (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'Hukadiria tafsiri ya tovuti nzima katika lugha (post_types, scope, engine) kabla ya kuianza.','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Soma mipangilio ya mtiririko wa kazi (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'Hurejesha tafsiri ya kiotomatiki wakati wa kuchapisha na kusasisha, uhakiki kabla ya kuchapisha, na kiwango cha juu, mtoa huduma na modeli ya ukaguzi wa ubora wa AI.','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya mtiririko wa kazi (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'Huweka on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider na quality_model.','When an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Wakati asili inapobadilika: hakuna chochote, weka alama kwenye tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati, au zitafsiri tena.','Translate a post into every language when it is published.'=>'Tafsiri chapisho kwa kila lugha linapochapishwa.','New translations wait for review instead of being published.'=>'Tafsiri mpya husubiri ukaguzi badala ya kuchapishwa mara moja.','Quality score below which a translation is flagged.'=>'Kiwango cha ubora ambacho chini yake tafsiri huwekwa alama.','AI provider of the quality check.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI wa ukaguzi wa ubora.','AI model of the quality check.'=>'Muundo wa AI wa ukaguzi wa ubora.','Translate the whole site'=>'Tafsiri tovuti nzima','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'Huanzisha kazi za tafsiri za chinichini kwa kila asili ya aina za maudhui zilizotolewa (aina zote zilizotafsiriwa wakati hakuna iliyotolewa): tafsiri zinazokosekana, zilizopitwa na wakati, au zote. Hurejesha kazi zilizoanzishwa, moja kwa kila lugha.','Check a translation with AI'=>'Kagua tafsiri ukitumia AI','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'Huwezesha AI kulinganisha tafsiri moja na asili yake na kuipa alama, na huhifadhi ripoti kwenye tafsiri hiyo. Hutumia muundo wa AI wa ukaguzi wa ubora uliowekwa katika mipangilio ya mtiririko wa kazi wa Tranzly.','The translation\'s post ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha chapisho la tafsiri.','Export a file for human translators'=>'Hamisha faili kwa ajili ya watafsiri wa kibinadamu','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). The same file can be imported back once translated.'=>'Hurejesha faili ya XLIFF au CSV (kama maandishi) iliyo na nakala asili na tafsiri zake katika lugha moja, kwa ajili ya mfasiri au shirika la tafsiri: machapisho yaliyotolewa, au ukurasa wa hadi nakala asili 100 za aina ya maudhui katika hali fulani (missing, stale, translated au all; rudia kwa after). Faili hiyo hiyo inaweza kuagizwa tena pindi itakapofasiriwa.','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'Maneno ambayo hayatafsiriwi kamwe (majina ya chapa na bidhaa).','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'Kwa kila msimbo wa lugha: neno la chanzo => tafsiri inayotumika daima.','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'Kulingana na msimbo wa lugha: urasmi (chaguo-msingi, zaidi, kidogo) na maagizo ya mtindo.','Read the glossary'=>'Soma faharasa','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'Hurejesha maneno ambayo hayajawahi kutafsiriwa, tafsiri za maneno thabiti na sauti kwa kila lugha.','Update the glossary'=>'Sasisha faharasa','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'Inabadilisha sehemu za faharasa unazotuma (maneno ambayo hayatafsiriwi kamwe, tafsiri za istilahi, sauti); sehemu unazoacha zinabaki. Inatumiwa na kila injini kuanzia tafsiri inayofuata na kuendelea.','Language suggestion'=>'Pendekezo la lugha','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Ukurasa huu unapatikana pia katika %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Soma katika %s','No thanks'=>'Hapana, asante','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Chagua jinsi lugha zitakavyoonekana kwenye anwani zako: folda, kikoa kidogo, kikoa tofauti au kigezo cha hoja.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Vikoa vidogo na vikoa tofauti kwa kila lugha ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Folda za lugha lazima ziwe orodha.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" haiwezi kuwa folda ya lugha. Tumia herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12, tarakimu au vistari, tofauti kwa kila lugha, na lisiwe neno ambalo WordPress tayari inatumia.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Vikoa lazima viwe orodha.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" si jina la kikoa, kama vile example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Kila lugha inahitaji kikoa chake yenyewe.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa lazima yawe orodha.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa lazima yaorodheshwe kwa kila lugha.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" haiwezi kutumika katika anwani. Tumia herufi ndogo, nambari na dashi.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Mpangilio huu umewashwa au umezimwa.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Kuficha kurasa ambazo hazijatafsiriwa kutoka kwa injini za utafutaji ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Lugha','Languages (side by side)'=>'Lugha (sambamba)','Add to Menu'=>'Ongeza kwenye Menyu','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Kwenye tovuti yako, kipengee hiki kinaonyesha lugha za tovuti, kila moja ikiunganisha kwenye ukurasa wa sasa katika lugha hiyo.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila moja ya lugha zako.','Language name'=>'Jina la lugha','Language code'=>'Msimbo wa lugha','Name and code'=>'Jina na msimbo','Design'=>'Muundo','Show each language as'=>'Onyesha kila lugha kama','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Onyesha bendera (bendera ni nchi, si lugha)','List'=>'Orodha','Pills'=>'Vidonge','Buttons'=>'Vitufe','Dropdown'=>'Menyu kunjuzi','Language codes'=>'Misimbo ya lugha','Flags'=>'Bendera','Include the current language'=>'Jumuisha lugha ya sasa','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ficha lugha ambazo ukurasa huu haujatafsiriwa','Stack vertically'=>'Panga wima','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayofikika','Text'=>'Maandishi','Background'=>'Mandhari nyuma','Current language text'=>'Maandishi ya lugha ya sasa','Current language background'=>'Mandhari ya nyuma ya lugha ya sasa','Border'=>'Mpaka','Corner radius'=>'Kipenyo cha pembe','Space between languages'=>'Nafasi kati ya lugha','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji','(no title)'=>'(hakuna kichwa)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Hakuna kitu cha kurekebisha hapa.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Hakuna aina ya maudhui iliyotafsiriwa kwenye tovuti hii.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Aina hiyo ya maudhui haijatafsiriwa kwenye tovuti hii.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Hakuna chochote cha kutafsiri katika uteuzi huo.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Chagua angalau lugha moja ya kutafsiri.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhamisha tafsiri.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Chagua faili ya XLIFF au CSV ya kuleta.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Hiyo si faili ya Tranzly XLIFF au CSV. Hamisha moja kwanza, iitafsiri, na uiingize hapa.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faili haikuweza kuhifadhiwa kwa ajili ya kuingizwa. Angalia ikiwa folda ya vipakizi inaweza kuandikika.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Uingizaji huo haupo tena. Pakia faili tena.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Ukurasa huo haupo tena kwenye tovuti hii.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Faili ni ya lugha ambayo tovuti hii haina.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Haikuweza kuunganisha %1$s %2$d: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Chapisho #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'Hakuna data kutoka kwa programu-jalizi hiyo iliyopatikana kwenye tovuti hii.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Huu si tafsiri ya kitu chochote kwenye tovuti hii.','There is no text to check.'=>'Hakuna maandishi ya kuangalia.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Mipangilio ya AI si sehemu ya toleo hili.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI hakujibu.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Muundo wa AI haukutathmini kila sehemu ya ukurasa huu. Jaribu tena, au chagua muundo mwingine.','Translator'=>'Mtafsiri','Translation reviewer'=>'Mhakiki wa tafsiri','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Mkaguzi ameomba mabadiliko kwenye tafsiri hii.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Mhakiki ameomba mabadiliko kwenye tafsiri hii: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Tafsiri hii inasubiri mkaguzi. Kuichapisha (kama mkaguzi) kunaidhinisha.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Tafsiri pekee ndiyo inayoweza kukaguliwa.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Chagua kinachotokea asili inapobadilika: hakuna, weka alama kwenye tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati, au uzitafsiri tena.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Kiwango cha ubora ni alama kuanzia 0 hadi 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Onyesha tena mapendekezo yaliyofichwa kwenye Muhtasari','All'=>'Zote','%d selected'=>'%d zimechaguliwa' . "\0" . '%d zimechaguliwa','Nothing matches.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana.','Select all on this page'=>'Chagua zote kwenye ukurasa huu','Select'=>'Chagua','Pages'=>'Kurasa','Previous'=>'Iliyopita','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ukurasa %1$d kati ya %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Sanidi %s kwa dakika chache','Start setup'=>'Anza kusanidi','This site'=>'Tovuti hii','Edition'=>'Toleo','Sites on this licence'=>'Tovuti zilizo kwenye leseni hii','Version'=>'Toleo','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Hii inaonekana kama nakala ya majaribio au ya ndani, kwa hivyo haitumii tovuti kwenye leseni yako.','See what Pro adds'=>'Ona kile Pro huongeza','Go to'=>'Nenda kwa','Personal'=>'Binafsi','Business'=>'Biashara','Agency'=>'Wakala','Any number of sites'=>'Idadi yoyote ya tovuti','Unlimited sites'=>'Tovuti zisizo na kikomo','%d site'=>'tovuti %d' . "\0" . 'tovuti %d','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Majaribio ya %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Jaribio lako limeanza. Pakia upya ukurasa ili uone kila kipengele cha Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Majaribio hayangeweza kuanza.','Feature'=>'Kipengele','Included'=>'Imejumuishwa','Not included'=>'Haijajumuishwa','Your licence'=>'Leseni yako','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d kati ya %2$d inatumika','Renews'=>'Hufanywa upya','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Nakala za staging, majaribio na localhost za tovuti ni za bure na hazihesabiwi kamwe katika kikomo cha tovuti yako.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Mpango wako unajumuisha usaidizi wa kipaumbele.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Dhibiti leseni na malipo yako','Get more with Pro'=>'Pata zaidi ukitumia Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Anza jaribio la bure la siku %d, hakuna kadi inayohitajika' . "\0" . 'Anza jaribio la bure la siku %d, hakuna kadi inayohitajika','See plans and prices'=>'Tazama vifurushi na bei','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for up to %d%% less.'=>'Unatumia Tranzly na Page Builder Sandwich pamoja? Kifurushi kinajumuisha programu-jalizi zote mbili za Pro kwa hadi %d%% pungufu.','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Unatumia Tranzly na Page Builder Sandwich pamoja? Kifurushi kinajumuisha programu-jalizi zote mbili za Pro kwa gharama nafuu.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake. Ihuyshe ili uendelee kupata masasisho na vipengele vya Pro.','Renew now'=>'Hifadhi upya sasa','Compare the plans'=>'Linganisha mipango','Search features'=>'Tafuta vipengele','Area'=>'Eneo','Included in'=>'Imejumuishwa katika','No feature matches.'=>'Hakuna vipengele vinavyolingana.','Features by plan'=>'Vipengele kulingana na mpango','Hide'=>'Ficha','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Iwashe kwenye skrini ya Programu-jalizi','Install it'=>'Isanidi','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Setup'=>'Usanidi','Plans and licence'=>'Vifurushi na leseni','Add-ons'=>'Viongezi','Get help'=>'Pata usaidizi','Feedback'=>'Maoni','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Chaguo lako halikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Hali ya usanidi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Match my computer'=>'Linganisha na kompyuta yangu','Light'=>'Nuru','Dark'=>'Giza','Colour scheme'=>'Mpangilio wa rangi','Help'=>'Msaada','Guide to this screen'=>'Mwongozo wa skrini hii','Take the tour'=>'Anza ziara','Get help or report a bug'=>'Pata usaidizi au ripoti hitilafu','Plugin screens'=>'Skrini za programu-jalizi','That could not be saved.'=>'Hiyo haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Before you contact support'=>'Kabla ya kuwasiliana na dawati la usaidizi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ombi lako linatumwa kutoka kwa tovuti hii hadi kwa %s, wanaotengeneza programu-jalizi hii. Tunatuma:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'anwani yako ya barua pepe na jina lako, ili tuweze kujibu;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mada na ujumbe unaoandika;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'kitambulisho chako cha leseni, ili wateja wanaolipa wapate kipaumbele;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'ikiwa tu utaiwekea alama: maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo ya WordPress na PHP, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo ya kumbukumbu ya hitilafu iliyoondolewa manenosiri na anwani za barua pepe), ambayo unaweza kuyasoma kabla ya kutuma;','Privacy policy'=>'Sera ya faragha','I agree, continue'=>'Ninakubali, endelea','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Muunganisho haukuweza kuangaliwa.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hiyo haikufanya kazi. Jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® umetenganisha tovuti hii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® hautambui tena tovuti hii.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Umetenganisha tovuti hii.','Connect this site to support'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Majibu yanakwenda kwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Hujaunganishwa. Bado unaweza kutuma ombi ukitumia anwani yako ya barua pepe hapa chini; kuunganisha kunaepusha kuichapa kila mara.','E-mail address'=>'Barua pepe','Your name (optional)'=>'Jina lako (hiari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ninakubali kuunganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®. Inatuma anwani ya tovuti hii, matoleo ya WordPress na PHP na toleo la programu-jalizi, na inaweza kutenganishwa wakati wowote kutoka hapa au na Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Unganisha','I need help'=>'Nahitaji usaidizi','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti hitilafu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','The site details could not be read.'=>'Maelezo ya tovuti hayakuweza kusomwa.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ombi lako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Maoni na maombi ya vipengele','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Nambari yako ya kumbukumbu ni %s, na jibu letu litatumwa kwa barua pepe.','What is it about?'=>'Inahusu nini?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Jibu kwa (barua pepe)','Subject'=>'Mada','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Ulitarajia nini, ulifanya nini, na nini kilitokea badala yake?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Jumuisha maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo ya kumbukumbu ya makosa)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Tazama hasa kile kinachotumwa','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','Send'=>'Tuma','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Funga ziara','Back'=>'Rudi','Everything in one place'=>'Kila kitu mahali pamoja','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Vichupo hivi vinaelekeza kwenye kila skrini ya programu-jalizi: usanidi, mipangilio, leseni yako, usaidizi na mengineyo.','Help on every screen'=>'Usaidizi kwenye kila skrini','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fungua menyu hii kwa mwongozo wa skrini uliyopo, ziara hii, au kutuomba msaada.','Light or dark'=>'Nuru au giza','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Chagua mwangaza, giza, au sawa na kompyuta yako. Chaguo lako linakumbukwa kwa ajili yako tu.','Welcome'=>'Karibu','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ziara hii fupi inaonyesha mahali vitu vilipo. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote kwa Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Tovuti yako kwa muhtasari','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Maendeleo ya usanidi na mpango wako yanaonyeshwa hapa, pamoja na jambo linalofuata linalofaa kufanywa.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Mpango wako, idadi ya tovuti unazoshughulikia, na iwapo nakala hii ya tovuti inahesabiwa kwenye kikomo hicho.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Jaribu Pro au pata toleo jipya','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Anza jaribio la bure bila kadi, pata toleo jipya, au fanya upya, yote kutoka hapa.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kila kipengele na kifurushi kinachokijumuisha. Tafuta kipengele au onyesha eneo moja kwa wakati mmoja.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zaidi kutoka Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Programu-jalizi zinazofanya kazi na hii, na huduma kutoka kwa timu hiyo hiyo. Kadi ulizoficha kwenye skrini nyingine zinaweza kuonyeshwa tena hapa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Unganisha ili upate usaidizi wa haraka zaidi','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Kuunganisha ni hiari. Inakuruhusu kutuma maombi bila kuandika barua pepe yako kila wakati, na unaweza kukata muunganisho wakati wowote upendao.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Omba usaidizi au uripoti hitilafu','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Eleza kilichotokea. Unachagua ikiwa utaambatisha maelezo ya tovuti, na unaweza kuona kwanza kile hasa inachojumuisha.','Tell us what to build'=>'Tuambie nini cha kujenga','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Tuma wazo, ombi la kipengele au maoni yoyote. Yataenda moja kwa moja kwa timu.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Hii inachukua dakika chache na kusanidi %s ili ifanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii mara moja. Unaweza kubadilisha kila kitu baadaye.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Uko tayari. Ikiwa chochote hakitafanya kazi inavyotarajiwa, tuko umbali wa mbofyo mmoja tu.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Maliza','Skip setup'=>'Ruka usanidi','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imejengwa na Neil Lock, Afisa Mtendaji Mkuu wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tovuti ya Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Installing WordPress\'s own words for this language in the background.'=>'Inasakinisha maneno ya WordPress yenyewe kwa lugha hii chinichini.','WordPress\'s own words are installed for this language (and %d plugin and theme translations).'=>'Maneno ya WordPress yenyewe yamesakinishwa kwa lugha hii (na tafsiri %d za programu-jalizi na mandhari).','Plugin and theme words are installed; WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress itself for this language yet.'=>'Maneno ya programu-jalizi na mandhari yamesakinishwa; WordPress.org bado haina tafsiri ya WordPress yenyewe kwa lugha hii.','WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress\'s own words for this language yet.'=>'WordPress.org bado haina tafsiri ya maneno yenyewe ya WordPress kwa lugha hii.','This site does not allow installing translations (file changes are switched off), so WordPress\'s own words stay in English for this language.'=>'Tovuti hii hairuhusu usakinishaji wa tafsiri (mabadiliko ya faili yamezimwa), kwa hivyo maneno ya WordPress yenyewe yatasalia kwa Kiingereza kwa lugha hii.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango na bei za Pro','Languages'=>'Lugha','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Lugha ya kwanza ni ile ambayo maudhui yako yameandikwa kwayo. Wageni hubadilisha kwa kizuizi cha kibadilisha lugha.','(default)'=>'(chaguo-msingi)','Find a language'=>'Tafuta lugha','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Andika jina lake katika lugha yako au katika lugha yake yenyewe, kisha lichague. Msimbo na jina hapa chini yatajazwa yenyewe.','Locale code'=>'Msimbo wa eneo','For example fr_FR'=>'Kwa mfano fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Jina (hiari)','For example Français'=>'Kwa mfano Français','Add language'=>'Ongeza lugha','Front-end output'=>'Toleo la upande wa mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi inachapisha kwenye kurasa zako huanza na kiambishi awali hiki, ili kurasa zisifichue ni programu-jalizi gani iliyounda. Herufi ndogo au nambari 1 hadi 8, kuanzia na herufi.','Beta updates'=>'Masasisho ya beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo ya beta kama visasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Toleo za beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wenye leseni ya Pro uliounganishwa kwenye akaunti zao. Baada ya kuunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kutoka kwa ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Save settings'=>'Hifadhi mipangilio','First engine that is set up'=>'Injini ya kwanza iliyosanidiwa','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Ufunguo umehifadhiwa. Umehifadhiwa ukiwa umesimbwa kwa njia fiche na hautaonyeshwa tena.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio ya injini imehifadhiwa.','Glossary saved.'=>'Faharasa imehifadhiwa.','Your keys'=>'Vifunguo vyako','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly huita huduma za tafsiri kwa kutumia akaunti yako mwenyewe. Funguo huhifadhiwa zikiwa zimesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwenye hifadhidata yako na hutumwa tu kwa huduma husika. Funguo za miundo ya AI huwekwa katika mipangilio ya AI.','%s API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API wa %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa: %s. Weka ufunguo mpya ili kuubadilisha, au hifadhi uga tupu ili kuuondoa.','No key saved.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo uliohifadhiwa.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Eneo la Azure (acha wazi kwa rasilimali ya ulimwengu)','Save key'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Angalia matumizi yangu ya DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'Herufi %1$s kati ya %2$s zimetumika katika kipindi hiki cha malipo.','Which engine translates'=>'Ni mtambo upi unaotafsiri','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Hakuna injini iliyowekwa bado. Hifadhi ufunguo hapo juu (au weka muundo wa AI) ili kuanza kutafsiri.','Default engine'=>'Injini chaguomsingi','A different engine or AI model per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini au modeli tofauti ya AI kwa kila lugha, mbadala wa kiotomatiki na ukomo wa matumizi ya kila mwezi ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Faharasa na maneno ambayo hayatafsiriwi kamwe','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Kamwe usitafsiri maneno haya (moja kwa kila mstari)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Majina ya chapa na bidhaa hubaki vile vile jinsi yalivyo, kwa kila injini.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendelewa na toni kwa kila lugha ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Save glossary'=>'Hifadhi faharasa','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Translation engine'=>'Injini ya kutafsiri','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Kile ambacho Tranzly hutafsiri kwenye tovuti hii','found, translated with your content'=>'imepatikana, imetafsiriwa pamoja na maudhui yako','not on this site'=>'haipo kwenye tovuti hii','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Ukiwa na Tranzly Pro: kurasa za Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen na WPBakery; kila kitu katika WooCommerce, kikiwa na bei katika sarafu ya mgeni; nyanja za SEO za Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress na All in One SEO; nyanja za ACF, Meta Box na Pods; fomu na barua pepe zake; maandishi yenyewe ya mandhari na programu-jalizi zako; pamoja na maoni na ukaguzi.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Maandishi ya duka na barua pepe','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Mada na vichwa vya barua pepe, majina ya mbinu za malipo na usafirishaji, na arifa za malipo. Barua pepe za kila agizo hutumwa kwa lugha iliyowekwa kwayo.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Fomu na barua pepe zake','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Kila fomu huweka orodha moja ya maingizo; lebo zake, vitufe, jumbe na barua pepe huonekana katika lugha ya mgeni.','Saved.'=>'Imehifadhiwa.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Bado hakuna sehemu za ACF, Meta Box au Pods zilizofafanuliwa.','Field'=>'Uga','Where'=>'Wapi','In a translation'=>'Katika tafsiri','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Nini hutokea kwa %s katika tafsiri','Translate it'=>'Tafsiri','Copy it as it is'=>'Inakili jinsi ilivyo','Leave it empty'=>'Acha tupu','The shop’s currency'=>'Sarafu ya duka','Currencies'=>'Sarafu','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Onyesha bei katika sarafu nyingine (sarafu ya duka yenyewe ni %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Viwango vya kubadilisha fedha','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Viwango vilisasishwa mara ya mwisho %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Viwango bado havijachukuliwa.','Update the rates now'=>'Sasisha viwango sasa','New currency'=>'Sarafu mpya','Choose…'=>'Chagua…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Kiwango (kwa kila 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Kuandika kiwango huifanya ibaki: sasisho la kila siku halitaibadilisha.','Rounding'=>'Uviringishaji','None'=>'Hakuna','Round up'=>'Zungusha kwenda juu','Round to the nearest'=>'Zungusha hadi karibu zaidi','Round down'=>'Punguza hadi nambari tasa ya chini','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Kadiria hadi (kwa mfano 1, 0.05 au 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Bei huishia kwa (kwa mfano 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ongeza sarafu','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Wageni gani wanaona sarafu gani','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Kulingana na nchi: msimbo wa nchi wa herufi mbili (kwa mfano CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Wageni kutoka %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Ruhusu wageni wachague (msimbo mfupi [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Bei sasa zinategemea kuki au nchi ya mgeni: hakikisha akiba ya ukurasa wako inatofautiana kulingana na kuki ya "tranzly_currency", au inatenga kurasa za duka.','Save currencies'=>'Hifadhi sarafu','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Maneno ambayo maudhui na programu-jalizi zako huchapisha zenyewe (vitufe, lebo). Soma maudhui au programu-jalizi mara moja, kisha utafsiri maandishi yake hapa; tafsiri yako inachukua nafasi ya ile ya programu-jalizi yenyewe.','%d texts'=>'maandishi %d','not read yet'=>'haijasomwa bado','Read again'=>'Soma tena','Read its text'=>'Soma maandishi yake','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Kazi imeanza ikiwa na tafsiri %d za kufanya. Inaendeshwa chinichini: unaweza kufunga ukurasa huu.','Queued again.'=>'Imewekwa tena kwenye foleni.','Running'=>'Inafanya kazi','Finished'=>'Imekamilika','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Weka injini ya tafsiri kwenye kichupo cha Injini kwanza.','Translate every'=>'Tafsiri kila','Into'=>'Ndani ya','With'=>'Na','Each language’s own engine'=>'Injini maalum ya kila lugha','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Chapisha tafsiri (vinginevyo zitahifadhiwa kama rasimu)','Estimate the cost'=>'Kadiria gharama','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Machapisho %1$d, vibambo %2$s. Bei ya injini hii haijulikani mapema.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Machapisho %1$d, herufi %2$s: takriban $%3$s kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe.','Start translating'=>'Anza kutafsiri','Jobs'=>'Kazi','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Bado hakuna kazi za utafsiri.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Kazi %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d kati ya %2$d imetafsiriwa, %3$d imeshindikana, %4$d imerukwa (imelindwa au tayari iko katika lugha hiyo)','%1$s: %2$d translated by %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d imetafsiriwa na %3$s','Stop this job'=>'Simamisha kazi hii','See what failed and why'=>'Tazama kilichoshindikana na sababu yake','Content'=>'Maudhui','Language'=>'Lugha','What went wrong'=>'Kilichoenda vibaya','Fix it'=>'Kirekebishe','Retry with'=>'Jaribu tena kwa','The same engine'=>'Injini ileile','Retry'=>'Jaribu tena','Translate by hand'=>'Tafsiri wewe mwenyewe','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Imesahihishwa na mtu, imelindwa','Translated by WordPress (language pack), at no cost. Type your own wording to use it instead.'=>'Imetafsiriwa na WordPress (kifurushi cha lugha), bila gharama yoyote. Andika maneno yako mwenyewe ili uyatumie badala yake.','Menus saved.'=>'Menyu zimehifadhiwa.','%d texts translated.'=>'Matini %d yametafsiriwa.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Masahihisho yako yamelindwa dhidi ya tafsiri ya mashine.','The same menu, translated'=>'Menyu sawa, iliyotafsiriwa','A separate menu per language'=>'Menyu tofauti kwa kila lugha','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Kwa chaguomsingi kila menyu hutafsiriwa: viungo vyake vinaelekeza kwenye kurasa zilizotafsiriwa, zikiwa na vichwa vyake. Badala yake, chagua menyu yake yenyewe kwa ajili ya lugha hapa.','Shared text'=>'Maandishi yaliyoshirikiwa','Which text'=>'Maandishi yapi','Menu labels'=>'Lebo za menyu','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Kichwa cha tovuti, kaulimbiu na vidude','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Violezo, vijajuu, vijachini na ruwaza','Translate the missing text'=>'Tafsiri maandishi yanayokosekana','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Hakuna maandishi ya kutafsiri hapa.','Save corrections'=>'Hifadhi masahihisho','Languages and settings'=>'Lugha na mipangilio','Engines'=>'Injini','Translation jobs'=>'Kazi za tafsiri','Addresses and SEO'=>'Anwani na SEO','Language switchers'=>'Vibadilisha lugha','SEO audit'=>'Ukaguzi wa SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Menyu na maandishi yaliyoshirikiwa','Integrations'=>'Miunganisho','No meta description'=>'Hakuna maelezo ya meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Toleo la lugha ambalo wageni hawawezi kufungua (rasimu, ya faragha au yenye nenosiri)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Anwani bado inatumia maneno ya asili','Still holds the original text'=>'Bado ina maandishi ya asili','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Ukaguzi wa lugha nyingi wa SEO ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro. Hutambua maelezo ya meta yaliyokosekana, hreflang zilizovunjika, anwani ambazo hazijatafsiriwa na maudhui yaliyorudiwa, kwa kila lugha.','Language to audit'=>'Lugha ya kukagua','Run the audit'=>'Endesha ukaguzi','Check the next pages'=>'Angalia kurasa zinazofuata','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'Kurasa %1$d zimeangaliwa, matatizo %2$d yamepatikana.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Lugha nzima imekaguliwa.','Page'=>'Ukurasa','Problem'=>'Tatizo','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Kazi %1$d imeanza: kurasa %2$d zinatafsiriwa chinichini. Ifuatilie kwenye Kazi za tafsiri.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'Tafsiri %d zinakaguliwa chinichini. Alama zitaonekana hapa kadiri zinavyowasili.','Missing'=>'Haikupatikana','Out of date'=>'Imepitwa na wakati','Translated'=>'Imetafsiriwa','Edited by a person'=>'Imehaririwa na mtu','Machine translated'=>'Imetafsiriwa na mashine','Waiting for review'=>'Inasubiri kukaguliwa','Needs a human look'=>'Inahitaji ukaguzi wa kibinadamu','Everything'=>'Kila kitu','Up to date'=>'Ya sasa','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly bado inatambua ni tafsiri zipi za zamani zilizopitwa na wakati. Idadi ya "zilizopitwa na wakati" itaongezeka wakati inafanya hivyo.','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','All content'=>'Maudhui yote','Average quality'=>'Ubora wa wastani','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d imetafsiriwa (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Onyesha','Translate everything missing'=>'Tafsiri kila kitu kinachokosekana','Update everything out of date'=>'Sasisha kila kitu kilichopitwa na wakati','Check the quality with AI'=>'Angalia ubora ukitumia AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Tafsiri kurasa zenye alama za chini tena','Nothing here.'=>'Hakuna kitu hapa.','Quality'=>'Ubora','by a person'=>'na mtu','waiting for review'=>'Inasubiri ukaguzi','Show more'=>'Onyesha zaidi','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Tafsiri tovuti nzima kwa pamoja (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Ukiwa na Tranzly Pro, chagua aina za maudhui na lugha, tazama makadirio, na utafsiri tovuti nzima kwa mkupuo mmoja.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'Kazi %d za chinichini zimeanzishwa, moja kwa kila lugha. Zifuatilie katika Kazi za tafsiri.','Content types'=>'Aina za maudhui','What to translate'=>'Cha kutafsiri','Only what is missing'=>'Kile tu kinachokosekana','Only what is out of date'=>'Vilivyopitwa na wakati pekee','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Kila kitu (kurasa zilizohaririwa na mtu hubaki zilivyo)','Estimate'=>'Makadirio','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Kurasa %1$d, herufi %2$s. Injini hii haichapishi bei.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'kurasa %1$d, herufi %2$s, takriban $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Tafuta maandishi','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d zaidi: andika katika "Find a text" ili kupunguza orodha.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Kitufe kidogo kwenye kona ya kila ukurasa, kwenye mandhari yoyote, bila usanidi wowote.','Off'=>'Imezimwa','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Kona ya chini, upande wa mwisho','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Kona ya chini, upande wa mwanzo','Top corner, end side'=>'Kona ya juu, upande wa mwisho','Top corner, start side'=>'Kona ya juu, upande wa mwanzo','Switcher around the content'=>'Kibadilishi kuzunguka maudhui','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ongeza kibadilishi kwenye kila chapisho na ukurasa','Before the content'=>'Kabla ya maudhui','After the content'=>'Baada ya maudhui','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Njia nyingine za kuongeza kibadilishaji','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Kihariri cha kizuizi na kihariri cha tovuti: kizuizi cha "Kibadilisha lugha", chenye miundo mitano.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: kipengele cha “Kibadilisha lugha”.','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menyu: Mwonekano → Menyu → kisanduku cha “Kibadilisha lugha”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Paupembeni: wijeti ya "Kibadilisha lugha".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Popote pengine, msimbo mfupi:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor na Bricks: wijeti ya "Kibadilisha lugha" katika kila kijenzi.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Wijeti za Elementor na Bricks ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Hifadhi','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Folda kwa kila lugha: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Kikoa kidogo kwa kila lugha: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Kikoa tofauti kwa kila lugha: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Kigezo cha hoja: example.com/?lang=de (tovuti za zamani)','Category'=>'Kipengele','Tag'=>'Lebo','Product'=>'Bidhaa','Product category'=>'Kitengo cha bidhaa','Product tag'=>'Lebo ya bidhaa','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Anwani zako za lugha zimebadilika kama inavyoonyeshwa hapa chini.','Language in the address'=>'Lugha katika anwani','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Jinsi wageni na injini za utafutaji wanavyofikia kila lugha','Address word for %s'=>'Neno la anwani kwa %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Lugha chaguomsingi haina neno katika anwani zake.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Kikoa cha %s (hiari)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Elekeza kikoa kwenye tovuti hii kwanza. Lugha isiyo na kikoa hutumia folda kwenye kikoa chako kikuu.','Where each language lives now'=>'Mahali kila lugha inapoishi sasa','Translated address words'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Anwani za kurasa na machapisho hutoka kwenye vichwa vyao vilivyotafsiriwa. Hapa unatafsiri maneno yasiyobadilika, kwa hivyo /de/kategorie/ inachukua nafasi ya /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (sasa “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Injini za utafutaji na wageni','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Wape wageni lugha yao wenyewe kwa bango dogo (kamwe sio kuelekeza kwingine)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ficha kurasa ambazo hazijatafsiriwa kutoka kwa injini za utafutaji (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Tafsiri ambayo bado ina maandishi asilia huwekwa kando ya matokeo ya utafutaji hadi itakapofasiriwa.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly huongeza viungo vya hreflang (pamoja na x-default), lugha na mwelekeo wa ukurasa, na kila lugha kwenye ramani ya tovuti yako:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Kufanya kazi pamoja na: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Kila neno la anwani lina herufi ndogo, tarakimu au dashi 2 hadi 12.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tafsiri ya kiotomatiki wakati wa kusasisha, majukumu ya mkaguzi, uhamishaji wa XLIFF kwa ajili ya watafsiri, kubadili kutoka WPML, Polylang au TranslatePress na ukaguzi wa ubora wa AI unakuja na Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Wakati asili inapobadilika','When a page is edited'=>'Ukurasa unapohaririwa','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Weka alama kwenye tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Tafsiri tafsiri zake tena chinichini','Do nothing'=>'Usifanye chochote','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Tafsiri iliyohaririwa na mtu haifutwi na kuandikwa upya; badala yake huwekwa alama kuwa imepitwa na wakati.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Tafsiri kurasa mpya katika kila lugha zinapochapishwa','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Muundo wa pili wa AI husoma kila tafsiri kando ya nakala yake ya asili, huipatia alama na kutaja makosa. Inatumia ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa AI kutoka kwa mipangilio ya AI. Anzisha ukaguzi kutoka kwa Hali ya tafsiri.','AI provider'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Muundo wa jumla wa mipangilio ya AI','Recommended'=>'Inapendekezwa','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Ukurasa unahitaji ukaguzi wa kibinadamu chini ya alama hii','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Chapisha tu tafsiri zilizoidhinishwa na mkaguzi','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Wape watu jukumu la Mtafsiri (huhariri tafsiri, kamwe si asili, hawezi kuchapisha) au jukumu la Mkaguzi wa Tafsiri (pia huidhinisha). Wakaguzi pia hupata kila kitu kinachosubiri katika orodha za Machapisho na Kurasa chini ya "Inasubiri"; kuchapisha kimoja hapo hukidhihirisha.','Manage users'=>'Dhibiti watumiaji','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Hakuna kinachosubiri mapitio.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Ujumbe kwa mfasiri (si lazima)','Read side by side'=>'Soma bega kwa bega','Approve'=>'Idhinisha','Ask for changes'=>'Omba mabadiliko','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'Tafsiri %d zimeingizwa na kulindwa dhidi ya tafsiri ya mashine.','Export and import for translators'=>'Hamisha na ingiza kwa ajili ya watafsiri','Not translated yet'=>'Haijatafsiriwa bado','Already translated'=>'Imeshatafsiriwa','Format'=>'Umbizo','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (zana za tafsiri)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (lahajedwali)','Download the file'=>'Pakua faili','Import a translated file'=>'Ingiza faili lililotafsiriwa','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Imetenguliwa: viungo %1$d vimeondolewa, kurasa %2$d zilizoingizwa zimefutwa.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Uendeshaji wa majaribio, hakuna kilichobadilishwa:','Imported:'=>'Imeingizwa:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'Lugha %1$d zimeongezwa, tafsiri %2$d zimeunganishwa, kurasa %3$d zimejengwa, maandishi %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Zima kwanza programu-jalizi nyingine (anwani na swichi zake zitagongana na Tranzly). Data yake inabaki mahali ilipo, kwa hivyo unaweza kurudi nyuma; Tendua huondoa kile hasa uingizaji uliongeza.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Hakuna data kutoka kwa programu-jalizi hii kwenye tovuti hii.','Languages: %s'=>'Lugha: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'bado inatumika: izime kwanza.','Dry run'=>'Jaribio kavu','Import'=>'Ingiza','Undo the import'=>'Tengua uagizaji','Comments and product reviews'=>'Maoni na tathmini za bidhaa','Each language keeps its own'=>'Kila lugha huhifadhi yake yenyewe','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Onyesha maoni ya kila lugha kwenye kila toleo','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Zionyeshe zote, zikiwa zimetafsiriwa kwa lugha ya msomaji','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Tafsiri hutumia injini yako ya tafsiri kwa kila maoni yaliyoidhinishwa. Barua taka na maoni yanayosubiri kudhibitiwa hayatumiwi kamwe.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Sehemu ulizobadilisha zimetiwa alama kuwa zimekaguliwa na mtu, na tafsiri hii imelindwa dhidi ya tafsiri ya mashine.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Mpangilio wa tafsiri hii ulibadilishwa kwenye kihariri, kwa hivyo baadhi ya vipande havilingani tena na vya asili. Vipande visivyo na wenza vinaonyeshwa vikiwa tupu; hariri vilivyobaki kwenye kihariri.','Open the editor'=>'Fungua kihariri','Original (%s)'=>'Asili (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Tafsiri (%s)','This piece has formatting or links, so it is shown with its HTML. Change only the words between the tags.'=>'Sehemu hii ina umbizo au viungo, kwa hivyo inaonyeshwa na HTML yake. Badilisha tu maneno yaliyo kati ya lebo.','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Open in the editor'=>'Fungua katika kihariri','Checked by a person'=>'Imekaguliwa na mtu','Imported'=>'Imeingizwa','Not in the translation'=>'Haipo kwenye tafsiri','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ongeza lugha ya pili chini ya Tranzly kwenye menyu ya msimamizi, na kibadilishaji kitaonekana hapa.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: bendera inawakilisha nchi, si lugha.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Kile ambacho visoma skrini hutangaza, kwa mfano "Chagua lugha".','Colours'=>'Rangi','Not translated'=>'Haijatafsiriwa','Original'=>'Asili','Published'=>'Imechapishwa','Draft'=>'Rasimu','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Imekaguliwa na mtu, imelindwa','Imported, protected'=>'Imeingizwa, imelindwa','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Haijatafsiriwa bado (nakala)','View'=>'Tazama','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Fungua ili iweze kutafsiriwa tena','Protect'=>'Linda','Publish the translations'=>'Chapisha tafsiri','Translate into %d language'=>'Tafsiri kwa lugha %d' . "\0" . 'Tafsiri kwa lugha %d','Show this block'=>'Onyesha kizuizi hiki','In every language'=>'Katika kila lugha','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Katika lugha zilizoteuliwa tu','In every language except those ticked'=>'Katika kila lugha isipokuwa zilizoteuliwa','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'Mawakala wa AI wanaruhusiwa. Pakia upya ukurasa huu ili kuona zana.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Wakala wa AI wamezimwa. Anwani yao ya unganisho haijibu tena.','Image per language'=>'Picha kwa kila lugha','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Onyesha picha nyingine kwa wasomaji wa lugha fulani, kwa mfano bango lenye maneno.','Replace the %s image'=>'Badilisha picha ya %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Chagua picha ya %s','Use the original image'=>'Tumia picha asili','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','The AI settings\' choice (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Chaguo la mipangilio ya AI (%1$s %2$s)','The AI settings\' choice'=>'Chaguo la mipangilio ya AI','Choose the AI model that translates each language, for example one model for Japanese and another for German. Languages without a choice of their own use the model for all other languages.'=>'Chagua modeli ya AI inayotafsiri kila lugha, kwa mfano modeli moja ya Kijapani na nyingine ya Kijerumani. Lugha zisizo na chaguo lake hutumia modeli ya lugha nyingine zote.','AI model for all other languages'=>'Muundo wa AI kwa lugha zingine zote','Engine for %s'=>'Injini ya %s','The default engine'=>'Injini chaguomsingi','AI model for %s'=>'Muundo wa AI kwa ajili ya %s','The model for all other languages'=>'Muundo wa lugha nyingine zote','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Injini ikishindwa au ikifikia kikomo, jaribu hizi zifuatazo, kwa mpangilio huu','Monthly spending caps'=>'Upeo wa matumizi ya kila mwezi','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Injini inapofikia kikomo chake, hakuna kitu kingine kinachotumwa kwake hadi mwezi ujao na ripoti ya tafsiri zilizoshindikana inaeleza sababu. Acha wazi ili kusiwe na kikomo.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (zilizotumika mwezi huu: $%2$s)','AI provider %1$s, every language it translates (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI %1$s, kila lugha inayotafsiri (zilizotumika mwezi huu: $%2$s)','Save spending caps'=>'Hifadhi viwango vya juu vya matumizi','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendekezwa (moja kwa kila mstari: neno = tafsiri)','Formality'=>'Urasmi','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Formal'=>'Rasmi','Informal'=>'Isiyo rasmi','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Maagizo ya mtindo (hadhira, sauti ya chapa)','Correct this translation'=>'Sahihisha tafsiri hii','Saving…'=>'Inahifadhi…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Maandishi yaliyotafsiriwa. Bonyeza Enter ili kuyarekebisha.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Bofya maandishi yoyote yaliyowekewa muhtasari ili kusahihisha tafsiri yake.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Hakuna maandishi yaliyotafsiriwa yaliyopatikana kwenye ukurasa huu ili kuhaririwa hapa. Tumia kihariri cha ubavu kwa ubavu badala yake.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kiteuzi cha lugha','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti. Haionyeshi chochote hadi lugha mbili au zaidi ziorodheshwe.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'Kigeuzi','block keywordtranslation'=>'Tafsiri','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Huwapa wageni uwezo wa kusoma ukurasa huu katika lugha nyingine miongoni mwa lugha zako: orodha, vidonge, vitufe, menyu kunjuzi au misimbo ya lugha, yenye bendera za hiari.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'Lugha nyingi']];